Subject: AdGuard Home: validate stable downloads and prevent automatic downgrades

Adapt the numeric ordering fix from kenzok78 b86a36ec2fc89adf3fa9dd015dd769b4d8f7d129
and the missing-log guard from 6aad9ba81aed80adf492c06e92aa1c74f18a45f1
to the ZqinKing 3610820 fork, preserving its nftables redirect implementation.
Pin stable defaults to the checked release tag, preserve existing links conffiles,
and validate every candidate's CLI version before stopping the installed core.

